---
layout: base.njk
pageType: sys
noindex: true
---
{#- /<locale>/qa/: the language's QA page (D56), linked from its system page. Lists the test pages under /<locale>/qa/. -#}
{%- set link = "underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink-brand focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus" -%}
{%- set testPages = collections.all | sysPages("qa", locale) -%}
<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-4 pt-16 pb-24 sm:px-6 md:pt-24 lg:px-8">
<p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-brand"><a href="/{{ locale }}/sys/" class="{{ link }}">System</a></p>
<h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-balance">{{ title }}</h1>
<p class="mt-4 text-lg text-ink-muted">Pages built to check the site by hand. Not in the sitemap, not linked from a public page, not indexed.</p>
<ul class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
{%- for p in testPages %}
<li><a href="{{ p.url }}" class="block h-full rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface-raised p-6 hover:border-brand-300 hover:bg-surface-alt focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus"><span class="block text-lg font-semibold">{{ p.title }}</span><code class="mt-2 block text-sm text-ink-muted">{{ p.url }}</code></a></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
</div>
